message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "EDS Spectrum Simulator"
abstract: >-
  An educational / R&D web app that visualizes counting statistics (Poisson
  noise), detector response, and multilayer thin-film matrix effects in
  energy-dispersive X-ray spectroscopy (EDS/EDX). Built with Streamlit,
  Plotly, and xraylib.
type: software
authors:
